@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Bibliographic source selection at startup
actor Administrator
participant "Spring Environment" as Config
participant BibliographicConfiguration as Composition
participant SourceSelection as Selection
participant BibliographicService as Service
Administrator -> Config : Set external bibliographic.sources before restart
Config -> Composition : Bind ordered identifier string
note over Composition : Spring supplies installed SourceRegistration beans.
Composition -> Selection : select(configured, installed registrations)
Selection -> Selection : Build local map; reject duplicate registrations
Selection -> Selection : Validate and resolve identifiers in order
alt Invalid selection
 Selection --> Composition : IllegalArgumentException
 note over Composition : Application startup fails.
else Valid selection
 Selection --> Composition : Immutable ordered source list
 Composition -> Service : new BibliographicService(selected, merge)
 note over Composition,Service : No provider lookup during selection.\nChanges take effect after restart.
end
@enduml
